Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "file_id": "string"
}

### Retrieves a vector store file. [Vector Stores]
GET {{baseUrl}}/vector_stores/{vector_store_id}/files/{file_id}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Delete a vector store file. This will remove the file from the vector store but the file itself will not be deleted. To delete the file, use the [delete file](/docs/api-reference/files/delete) endpoint. [Vector Stores]
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/vector_stores/{vector_store_id}/files/{file_id}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Create a vector store file batch. [Vector Stores]
POST {{baseUrl}}/vector_stores/{vector_store_id}/file_batches
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "file_ids": [
    "string"
  ]
}

### Retrieves a vector store file batch. [Vector Stores]
GET {{baseUrl}}/vector_stores/{vector_store_id}/file_batches/{batch_id}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Cancel a vector store file batch. This attempts to cancel the processing of files in this batch as soon as possible. [Vector Stores]
POST {{baseUrl}}/vector_stores/{vector_store_id}/file_batches/{batch_id}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{apiKey}}

{}

